# Keep repository text files byte-identical across platforms.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with `core.autocrlf=true` checks the generated
# service-reality baseline out with CRLF while the generator emits LF, so
# `bun run services:check` fails on identical content. Normalising in the
# repository is what makes the gate mean the same thing everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending translated or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.rar binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
